SO-ARM101 ROS2 URDF package assets

This directory contains SO-ARM101 URDF/XML/STL assets and a ROS2 package wrapper.

Original robot asset source:
https://github.com/TheRobotStudio/SO-ARM100/tree/main/Simulation/SO101

Original robot asset repository license: Apache-2.0

ROS2 package wrapper source:
https://github.com/MuammerBay/SO-ARM_ROS2_URDF

The wrapper package metadata declares license "BSD" in package.xml, but the
source repository did not include a full BSD license text when this notice was
added. The package.xml metadata is retained for traceability.

Keep this notice with the assets when redistributing them.
